締役。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供の頃から仕事ばかりの両親や、家庭環境に不満を抱いていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鋭い洞察力と判断力を持つ切れ者だが、私生活はだらしなく、酒と煙草が大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"偶然拾ったあおばのカードケースの中身を見て彼女が未来人だと見抜き、それを記事にしようと画策し、あおばに接触する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10292","sourceWorkId":"15213","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"出版社『东都エース』的记者。父亲是鹿妻组的代表法人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"从小就对只顾着工作的父母与家庭环境抱有不满。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拥有敏锐的观察力和判断力，但不注重私生活，喜欢烟酒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"偶然从捡到的あおば的名片夹中发现她是未来人，想着要以此发表新闻而去接触あおば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「真是的……拜托别老是插手我的事。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16848"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/80289da991ea18ff2564e621a6f67161116a07c0b9358a8d70eb9e70479fe554.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dcf42dc60e4bca2068055b6dd5badf4fd349eea473c14f0a9a11e68a845e009f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"若林直美","creatorId":"vndb:s446","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s446","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s446","name":"若林 直美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:27086:16848:3934:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33908","characterName":"中野 栄","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16850","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"27086"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10293"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33908"},"originalCharacterName":"中野 栄","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1216"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"46"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"仙北第二女学園に通う女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"話し方はいかにも今時といった感じ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼氏がいたものの別れてしまい、その別れ方や話しぶりも、サラッとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"新しいものや流行には敏感な方で、駅前でストリートミュージシャンの演奏を観たりもする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仙石市内ではなく、隣町の仙山町に住んでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10293","sourceWorkId":"15213","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"就读于仙北第二女学园的女生。说话的方式相当跟得上潮流。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与男朋友分手之后，就不会对这个男朋友以及相关话题说半个字。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对新事物与流行很敏感，会在车站前观看街头表演者的音乐演奏。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不是住在千関市内，而是住在隔壁的仙山町。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「呵……真的不是搭讪？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16850"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cb5a64390119bf1e7cc74cef148d9ef62693be3c3b08f2553b5e319104cd443f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/ac929f62e93c92f67b26ae841ae9f98b3a5afbd567dd9978b34d6dd5d0e7622f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"眞田朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s610","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s610","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s610","name":"眞田 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:27086:16850:5928:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33910","characterName":"テルサ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16853","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"27086"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10294"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33910"},"originalCharacterName":"テルサ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"???"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"???"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前あおばが借りた魔法書を持ち、あおばの前に現れた少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまり感情の見えない表情や、落ち着いた口調、そして神秘的な雰囲気が、あおば達とは違う何かを醸し出している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10294","sourceWorkId":"15213","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"拥有以前あおば所借的魔法书，在あおば面前出现的少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不怎么表现出感情的表情，冷淡的口吻，再加上神秘莫测的氛围，酝酿出一种与あおば她们有所差别的东西。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「时间回溯，就跟追求不老不死一样，是人类的浪漫吧？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16853"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc1a5c84eb4966e3461c016097f8970004246368e9ee83483f153b09c9bdf912.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fac8546b595e782b5c4af576f1b7079404d2572e48f1fb4ea17fddbaf1298655.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"五十嵐裕美","creatorId":"vndb:s77","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s77","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s77","name":"五十嵐 裕美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:27086:16853:5208:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33911","characterName":"カエラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16854","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"27086"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10295"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33911"},"originalCharacterName":"カエラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"???"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"???"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"あおば達の前に突然現れた謎の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長い金髪に異国の血を思わせるような容姿。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仙石町駅前でインタビュアーに絡まれて困る麻智を助ける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ノリが良く、ハッキリとした言葉遣いの裏には、どこか人をからかうように感じる部分も。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10295","sourceWorkId":"15213","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"突然出现在あおば她们面前的神秘少女。长长的金发让人觉得她有外国血统。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在千関町的车站前帮助了因为被采访而为难的麻智。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"做事积极，说话干脆利落的反面又让人有一种正被她捉弄着的感觉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「你，会觉得是因为哪个人的影响，才会一直这样拼命的吗？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16854"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/0051197c9965b58e302f06fdd261c92b3ea885d1cdc599ffaefff8b2e062cc1f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5e3b37990b2db710c2cfe3baf99bdc5cf67d4df1af7de4348eaf15e158163744.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高田初美","creatorId":"vndb:s363","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s363","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s363","name":"高田 初美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:27086:16854:5052:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c33904","characterName":"石巻 あおば","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c33904"},"originalCharacterName":"石巻 あおば","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"609"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","valu